    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API enables the seamless integration of multiple shopping carts into a single, unified cart experience. By using this API, businesses can enhance customer satisfaction by ensuring that users can merge items from different carts, streamlining the checkout process. This functionality is particularly valuable for businesses aiming to provide a cohesive shopping experience across different devices or sessions. Typical consumers of this API include e-commerce platforms and app developers looking to optimize the user journey and maximize conversions.",
