          "Cart Management"
        ],
        "summary": "Merge items from another cart into the current cart.",
        "description": "This operation allows you to combine items from a specified cart into the current user's cart, ensuring that any duplicate items are correctly updated and quantities adjusted accordingly. Use this endpoint when you want to consolidate items from multiple carts into one.",
